       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ACCTCALC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY ACTLNK.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LNK-CALC-AREA.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           IF LNK-TX-TYPE = 'D'
               ADD LNK-TX-AMOUNT TO LNK-BALANCE GIVING LNK-NEW-BALANCE
           ELSE
               SUBTRACT LNK-TX-AMOUNT FROM LNK-BALANCE GIVING LNK-NEW-BALANCE
           END-IF.
           GOBACK.
